@k.words.powder.noun.2 k.words.sense word=powder pos=noun n=2 gloss="a mixture of potassium nitrate, charcoal, and sulfur in a 75:15:10 ratio which is used in gunnery, time fuses, and fireworks" synonym=gunpowder is_a=explosive core.source="wordnet 3.1"
