@k.words.pox.noun.1 k.words.sense word=pox pos=noun n=1 gloss="a common venereal disease caused by the treponema pallidum spirochete; symptoms change through progressive stages; can be congenital (transmitted through the placenta)" synonym=syphilis synonym=syph synonym="lues venerea" synonym=lues is_a="venereal disease" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.words.pox.noun.2 k.words.sense word=pox pos=noun n=2 gloss="a contagious disease characterized by purulent skin eruptions that may leave pock marks" is_a="contagious disease" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
